The [[Fortuna's Hope]] is a [[weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Shortbow]] with two [[Lucky Clover]]s, which can both normally only be obtained by [[Ranger]]s. It does the least damage of the [[Shortbow]] upgrades, but has a high chance of giving {{icon/luck}} on hit, making it very synergistic with the [[Ranger Bag]] and [[Acorn Collar]] (as well as the [[Acorn Collar]] variants).
